Structured Prompt 
Role- Act as a senior functional tester.
Context- We are testing the search module of an online flight booking application.
Task- Generate automation test cases for the search section.
Input- Search a flight by entering from and to city location, Departure date, Number of Passengers, the travel class and allow the user to select one flight
Constraints: Include only functional, negative and boundary test cases. Exclude performance, API and security testing
Output- Provide the result in a table format with rows as Test Case Id, Scenarios, Steps, Test Data and Expected Result 

Zero-Short Prompting-
Generate automation test case for an online flight booking application where the users can select one flight by entering from and to city locations, Departure date, Number of Passengers and the travel class

One-Short Prompting- 
Generate boundary testcases for the search field that accepts from and to city location, Departure date, Number of Passengers, the travel class and allow the user to select one flight 
Example-
1. verify flight search by valid from and to city location, Departure date, Number of Passengers, the travel class
Output= Available flights in the desired location is displayed

